## What it is

Explore Los Santos through GTA V’s story and GTA Online in the Enhanced PC edition. This profile points to the GTA V Enhanced official Steam page and records the PC system requirements shown there.

## GTA V Enhanced PC system requirements

These figures are copied from the [official Steam page for Grand Theft Auto V Enhanced](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3240220/?l=english) on 10 November 2026. They are the store’s requirements, not a GameNews benchmark. Steam says downloadable content and later changes can change them.

The minimum column lists Windows 10 with the latest service pack, a 64-bit processor, an Intel Core i7-4770 or AMD FX-9590, 8 GB of memory, an NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1630 with 4 GB or an AMD Radeon RX 6400 with 4 GB, a DirectX 10 compatible sound card, and 105 GB of space. Steam says an SSD is required.

The recommended column lists Windows 11, an Intel Core i5-9600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600, 16 GB of memory, an NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 with 8 GB or an AMD Radeon RX 6600XT with 8 GB, and the same 105 GB. Steam says that storage should be an SSD with DirectStorage compatibility, and that a Windows Spatial Sound-compatible system is required for its spatial-audio note. A Dolby Atmos experience needs a solution that supports Dolby Atmos.

Steam also says installation and online play require a Rockstar Games account and an internet connection. A minimum listing is the publisher’s floor, not a promise of a particular frame rate.

## GTA V Enhanced vs Legacy on PC

These are two different Steam listings, checked on 10 November 2026. Enhanced is app 3240220, released on Steam on 4 March 2025. [Grand Theft Auto V Legacy](https://store.steampowered.com/app/271590/?l=english) is app 271590, released on Steam on 13 April 2015. Both listings are Windows-only.

Legacy’s minimum column lists Windows 10 64-bit, an Intel Core 2 Quad Q6600 or AMD Phenom 9850, 4 GB of memory, an NVIDIA 9800 GT with 1 GB or an AMD HD 4870 with 1 GB, and 125 GB of space. A PC that meets that older minimum can still fall short of the Enhanced minimum above, including its 8 GB memory floor, newer graphics cards, and SSD requirement.

Steam’s short description of Enhanced says the games are upgraded for a new generation with visuals, faster loading, and 3D audio. That is the store’s wording. GameNews has not compared the two editions in play.

## GTA V Enhanced official Steam page

Use the Steam button on this page for app 3240220. Installation is handled by Steam. GameNews does not host the download, and this released PC edition is not GTA VI.

## Is this your kind of game?

This is GTA V Enhanced, a released game separate from the upcoming GTA VI. Confirm the edition you intend to install and check the current listing for its included content before purchasing.

## Download and purchase

This is a paid game. Check the official store for current regional pricing, editions, and purchase terms. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

Check the Enhanced edition’s own PC requirements; meeting the requirements of an older edition does not establish compatibility with this one.

## Before installing

Compare your operating system, processor, memory, graphics support, and available storage with the complete current requirements. A minimum specification is not a promise of a particular frame rate on your computer. Leave room for updates and check any additional account requirements before downloading.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information and PC requirements checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3240220/?l=english) on 10 November 2026. The Legacy comparison uses the [Legacy Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/271590/?l=english) from the same check. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/), checked 16 October 2026. This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
